title: "CIR: cost-to-capability research on AI architectures and learning systems (research repository)"
type: generic
authors:
  - name: "DotrixAI"
    website: "https://dotrixai.com"
version: "2026-10-05"
date-released: "2026-10-05"
url: "https://dotrixai.com/cir"
repository: "https://github.com/DotrixAI/cir-research"
abstract: >-
  CIR is a DotrixAI research program investigating AI architectures and learning
  systems with lower cost-to-capability than strong Transformer baselines. This
  repository documents the objective, methodology, current evidence, negative and
  superseded results, and limitations. It does not contain the CIR implementation.
keywords:
  - cost-to-capability
  - efficient language models
  - recurrent models
  - delta rule
  - baselines
  - research methodology
